                <div type="textpart" xml:id="CommNote">
                    <label>Commemorative note on Zechariah, the father of John the Baptist</label>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit">
                        <ab>
                            በስመ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ኣመ፡ ሰሙኑ፡ ለመስከረም፡ በዛቲ፡ ዕለት፡ ካነ፡ ቅዱስ፡ 
                            <persName ref="PRS10509Zachary">ዘካርያስ፡</persName> ካህን፡ ወልደ፡ በራክዩ፡ ሰማዕተ፡ 
                            በእዴሁ፡ ለሄሮድስ፡ ንጉሥ።
                        </ab>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" xml:id="Salam">
                    <label>Salām-hymn to Zechariah, the father of John the Baptist</label>
                    <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit">
                        <ab>
                            ሰላም፡ እብል፡ ለ<persName ref="PRS10509Zachary">ዘካርያስ፡</persName> ካህን፡
                        </ab>
                    </div>
